              "name": "Marsh Mom"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Fantastic!! We love blue cheese, and this dish was amazing. The only change we made was we used half &amp; half instead of heavy cream to lighten up the calorie load just a bit. AWESOME RECIPE - will definitely make again! (and again, and again..)"
          },
