            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DREGINEK"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Awesome sauce! Like others, changed out the pasta (used brand Rana; mushroom Ravioli) and added some sautéd mushrooms. While I didn’t this time, I could see sautéd spinach another nice add too. I interpreted “pinch” to mean 1/8 tsp of each spice; divine!! Sprinkled a little freshly grated Parmesan on each bowl - which wasn’t necessary but a nice “pretty” touch! Will absolutely make this super easy meal again!! I will also consider adding protein like thin sliced sirloin or grilled chicken but truly GREAT as written!! Thanks VictoRi!! Kudos!!",
            "datePublished": "2023-02-01T02:00:17.022Z"
          },
